<title>USA: Advanced says two board members resign.</title>
<headline>Advanced says two board members resign.</headline>
<dateline>HALLANDALE, Fla. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Viral Research Corp said Wednesday Robert Kolodny William Gedale resigned from the board.</p>
<p>The company declined to provide further information.</p>
</text>
